00:53:07,500 --> 00:53:13,500
Once Upon a Time in Venice is a 2017 American crime comedy film directed by Mark
Cullen in his directorial debut, who co-wrote with his brother Robb.

11
00:58:26,250 --> 00:58:32,250
The film stars Bruce Willis, Jason Momoa, John Goodman, Thomas
Middleditch, Famke Janssen, Adam Goldberg, and Jessica Gomes.

12
01:03:45,000 --> 01:03:51,000
The film follows private detective Steve Ford (Willis) and his assistant (Middleditch) as they face
many tasks, notably the capture of Ford's dog by a gang leader named Spyder (Momoa).

13
01:09:03,750 --> 01:09:09,750
Once Upon a Time in Venice was released in a limited theatrical release and
through video on demand on June 16, 2017, by RLJ Entertainment.

14
